WEBVTT

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:16.010
Beautiful blossoms.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.690
I know you are there.

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:26.470
This is our turf!  You need to pay up missy.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.160
How bothersome.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:36.190
Boss, could she be the black hair bandit hunter?

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:38.000
Huh, what did you say?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.430
Haven't you heard?

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:46.290
There is this beautiful martial artist who killed bandits attacking her on the mountain roads.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.220
Everybody's been talking about it.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.620
Who cares!

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.610
I will cut your black hair and make a beautiful silky wig for myself!

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.450
Oh my world...

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:10.540
I, Kan'u.  You, who takes advantage of these chaotic times and cause suffering of people.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.870
If you want to apologize for your cruelty, then do it in hell.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.160
Bring it on.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:23.720
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:29.050
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:33.240
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:42.470
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:48.820
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:54.950
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:01:55.020 --> 00:02:01.420
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:07.600
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:02:08.010 --> 00:02:14.560
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:02:14.590 --> 00:02:17.080
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:24.020
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:29.740
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:36.440
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:41.690
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:44.470
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:18.970
Bandits have been lurking around here recently.

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:23.120
Many villagers were killed after all their worthy possession was stolen from them.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:27.720
These flowers are for the dead souls.

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.120
I see.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:34.840
This would not have happened if the guards did their duties.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:38.300
The world is not safe anymore.

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:45.560
Getting so expensive...

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:50.330
I can't believe a place like this is crawling with bandits.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:53.120
What's going on?

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:54.360
There they are!!

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:55.280
Bandits?

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:00.490
Out of the way!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:04.460
Here come the Rin Rin bandits!

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:08.730
Kids?

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:19.300
W-what the heck was that?

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:24.680
<b>The Sisterhood of Kan'u, Chōhi and the Sisters</b>

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:28.630
What a mess!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.390
This is not a laughing matter.

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.800
Who were those little brats anyways?

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:35.540
I think they called themselves the Rin Rin Bandits.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:40.010
As their name suggests, they are a group of bandits led by Rin Rin.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:45.540
They love to play havoc with the farm animals.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:53.370
A few days ago, some drew the village chief's portrait on the wall of his own house!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.710
That was a masterpiece.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:05:01.710
What are their parents doing?  They should discourage them from playing bandits.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.190
She doesn't have parents.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:06.370
What?!

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:10.560
They were killed by the bandits when she was younger.

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:18.050
After their murder, she moved to the suburbs to live with her grandfather.

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.370
And after his death...

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.110
she was left all alone.

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.970
She's a very good girl underneath...

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:29.610
Just a little mischievous now.

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:33.300
Her gang members' parents have forgiven her.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:39.500
May I make a request please.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.460
A request?

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:50.520
We were victorious as usual!

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:56.050
I heard someone cleaned off the drawing from the village chief's wall.

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.910
What a big waste.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:05:59.860
It is!

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:00.770
Who cares?

00:06:01.480 --> 00:06:05.370
Next time we should draw something even bigger!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.240
That's our Big Boss!

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.370
Rin Rin bandits are the best.

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.450
Yay, the best!

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:16.430
It’s time to go home.

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:17.080
Right!

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.540
Me too.

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:21.230
- Me too.
- Me too.

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:23.500
Bye Big Boss!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:24.980
See you tomorrow!

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:25.650
Yup.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.970
We will get together again tomorrow!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.800
We will see each other again tomorrow…

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:54.490
tomorrow… we could…

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:02.670
Man, that lady drives such a hard bargain!

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:06.690
Well, it beats sleeping on a trail road any day.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:12.140
Parents murdered by the bandits…

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.380
<i>Aisha, wake up! Aisha!</i>

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:18.210
<i>Big brother, what’s going on?</i>

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.140
<i>The battle has started.  Our village is under attack.</i>

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:21.170
<i>What?!</i>

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:24.110
<i>Hurry, hide under the bed!</i>

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:29.420
<i>Close your eyes and don’t make a sound.</i>

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.030
<i>Where's the money?!</i>

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:36.290
<i>You're supposed to be on our side...</i>

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:38.170
<i>Big brother... big brother...</i>

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:43.460
<i>Let's run away and be bandits...</i>

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:44.850
<i>I found them!</i>

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:58.480
That’s amazing!  But can't you do it like normal?

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:02.970
I don’t have any experience in cooking, so…

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:07.220
Never mind, just clear the weeds and when you're done, clean up the shop…

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:09.550
Then tidy up the storage.

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:12.410
And cut some firewood from the mountain.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:13.370
You better hurry up!

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:17.890
Uh, Um…, this is too many chores for one person.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:24.410
Clearing up the weeds, cleaning the shop, cutting firewood, and…

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:32.900
Listen up!  This has gone too far even for a brat!  Don't let your guard down.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.770
What's going on?

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:39.460
I heard they are going to arrest Rin Rin.

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:42.610
Arrest her?  That’s a harsh sentence for a kid.

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:47.110
The drawing really made him livid.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:50.820
That was the last straw for him.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:57.980
Those gutless officials, they are terrified of the real bandits, but this time...

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:00.240
What will become of her?

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:05.310
I don’t think they will execute her.  She may be whipped or caned.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.820
What a pity.

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:12.260
Excuse me chief, sorry for the intrusion.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.720
Who are you?

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:20.070
My name is Kan'u Unchō.  I am a traveling martial artist.

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:25.290
From what I understand, Rin Rin's causing you a lot of troubles.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:29.880
It is not in your benefit if your guards get injured.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.700
Please leave this job to me.

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.600
Leave it to you?

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:38.170
You have a scary weapon in your hand, but are you strong?

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:42.790
I don't know how strong I am, but I have some useful skills.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:45.780
These kids may call themselves bandits, but they're nothing...

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.930
Compared to real bandits…

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:54.140
Could you be the famous black hair bandit hunter?

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:55.380
Really?!

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:59.360
Well, I don't refer to myself as that.

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:04.700
It was rumored that the legendary black hair hero is a beauty.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.860
But I guess it was just a rumor!

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:10.080
Uh, what was that supposed to mean?

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:12.990
She might not be reliable.

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:16.280
There is no harm in letting her try.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:21.570
This tree is the marking point.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:26.240
I should turn left here and follow the road.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:35.400
Who are you?!

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:38.290
This is the Rin Rin bandits' territory.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:40.750
Turn back, government spy.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:43.310
Hey, stop that! You might hurt someone.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:48.110
Take this!  I won't let you arrest our Big Boss!

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.740
I've had enough.

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:08.800
I am saved!

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:10.850
Now, I wouldn't say that.

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:25.160
Hey, ugly!

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:27.510
Old hag!

00:11:28.650 --> 00:11:31.540
What?!  Who you are calling Old?!

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:34.450
A trap, huh?

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:39.670
I guess I should compliment you on your cleverness.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.920
But I can't call myself Kan'u Unchō, if I would fall for such a simple trap.

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:51.000
Surrender now!

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.660
She Fell!  She Fell!

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:56.870
What a tool!

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:58.380
We tricked her!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.130
Yup!

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:02.890
This is so humiliating.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.330
What should we do?

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:05.860
Bury her?

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:07.860
Let's pee on her first!

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.650
Let's do it!

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:12.110
Take this!

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:14.570
Squeeze!

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:17.030
Bear hug!

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:19.500
Pinch hitter!

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:25.960
Our Big Boss will not lose to someone like you.

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:30.560
I know, I know. I wouldn't do anything to hurt Rin Rin.

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.340
You all need to return home.

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:35.490
Really?

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:39.280
If we return, will you arrest our Big Boss and hand her over to the chief?

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.300
Hand her over chief?

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.760
I won't. I promise.

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:44.820
Let’s go back.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.730
- Okay.
- Yeah.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.910
Let's go, let's go.

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:58.000
Ugly!  Stupid!  Old hag! We hope our Big Boss beats you to a pulp!

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:06.060
I guess compared to them I am a bit old.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.780
So, are you Rin Rin?

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:48.060
Rin Rin is my real name, but only my friends and family can call me that!

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:50.270
And you're neither.

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:51.720
I see.

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:55.560
Let’s start again, what is your name?

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:58.600
My name is Chōhi Yokutoku!

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:02.790
I am the Big Boss of the Rin Rin bandits.  Our name brings fear to all, even in sleeping children!

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:06.060
I have already sent your gang back to the village.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.910
What have you done to my friends?

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:16.690
Nothing too much, just a little punishment.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:21.650
You… To avenge my comrades, I will repay you ten times the punishment.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:25.490
You probably won’t listen to me anyway.

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:28.750
In that case, I will beat some sense into you.  Bring it!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.020
Strong...

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:43.860
I will lose to her in a battle of strength…

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:01.440
You're a very skilled fighter.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:02.620
You're not too bad yourself.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:07.130
But Rin Rin hasn't even begun to fight!

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:36.480
What a waste.

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:38.690
What do you mean by that?

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:44.290
You‘re so strong, yet you use your strength to play bandit.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:45.890
It’s none of your business.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:51.190
Chōhi, I was told your parents were killed by bandits.

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:53.730
S-so?!  What's it to you?!

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:56.770
I lost my family at a very young age as well.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:02.160
My village was caught in a war.  My dad and mom… and my big brother…

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:07.260
I swore to myself that I will never cry again over this incident...

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:10.150
And vowed never to let it happen again to anyone.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:13.110
What does this have to do with Rin Rin?

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:15.990
Haven't you ever thought about changing the world?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:22.370
Being caught up in war, attacked by bandits, killing innocent people.  This freaking chaotic world!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.380
Who can understand all this crazy talk?!

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:33.640
I have always been alone…

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:38.410
But I don't know what to do…  That’s why, that’s why...

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:53.050
What’s the matter?  Why are you crying?

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:54.230
Hey...

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:08.990
This is not how I expected things to turn out.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:15.740
<i>What do you mean “do whatever you want with me”?</i>

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:19.710
<i>Because I cried in the middle of battle…  It caused me to lose to you.</i>

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:23.680
<i>So, the winner can do anything to the loser.</i>

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.340
<i>Even if you say so…</i>

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:31.210
<i>All I want is for you to apologize to the villagers and the chief.</i>

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:34.240
<i>And stop all your mischievous antics.</i>

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:35.600
<i>Can you do that?</i>

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:37.610
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:41.600
<i>Okay then.  I will be right next to you when you apologize to everyone.</i>

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:45.570
<i>Let's meet up at the entrance of the village.   I will be going back then.</i>

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:51.090
<i>It's dangerous to travel across the roads on the mountain at night.</i>

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:54.080
<i>So you should stay over at my place tonight.</i>

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:58.440
<i>I‘ve been used to traveling for a quite long time, it will be alright.</i>

00:17:59.020 --> 00:17:59.780
<i>See you.</i>

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:09.060
<i>I change my mind.</i>

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.320
<i>Is it alright for me to spend the night here?</i>

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.590
Is the water hot enough?

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:17.370
It's just fine.

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:19.560
Well then, Rin Rin is going to take a bath too!

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.640
I'm coming in!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:26.560
Hey, why can’t you be a little more careful getting in?!

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:30.530
Seriously, even getting in the bathtub…

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:35.500
What's the matter now?

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:37.730
Your boobs are so big!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:44.710
How do they get so bouncy?

00:18:44.840 --> 00:18:46.170
Even If I told you…

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.730
That's right; it’s all in the heart!

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:52.920
If you have big dreams in your heart, you will grow big boobs, probably.

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:56.410
Really, honestly?!  Just by doing that you can make them grow as big as yours?!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:01.030
That might just work for you.

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:02.360
Okay then!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:05.850
Rin Rin will have big dreams in her heart!

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:09.210
That's right.  Just go ahead and do it.

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:13.830
After all, having a big dream is not a bad thing.

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.540
You can use my pillow.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:17.720
Okay.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:19.010
Oh?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.800
It looks like Rin Rin's clothes are too small…

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:24.430
It fits fine.

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:27.930
Sorry for the trouble, you even have to share your bed.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:33.190
It's alright.  I lost the battle so sleeping together can’t be avoided.

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:37.230
Somehow, I don’t think you meant what you said!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:44.410
And it has been such a long time since I slept with someone.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.580
I had no intention of not letting you sleep with me.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:51.620
And it makes me feel like I am sleeping with my... mother.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:58.050
What?!  How dare you!  I'm not old enough to be your mother!  Sister, maybe!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.050
Sister...?

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:05.050
Sadly, I haven’t done anything yet that can make me a... mother.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:08.260
Then can I think of you as my older sister?

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:11.930
I guess its fine, if that's what you want.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:15.520
Great!  From now on, I will tell everyone that you are Rin Rin's older sister!

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:16.020
What?!

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:20.460
I said you can "think" of me as a sister, not tell everyone that I am!

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:23.670
So... I can’t think of you as a sister...?

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:28.540
Well, I guess you could, but…

00:20:28.690 --> 00:20:31.450
Yay!  Rin Rin has an older sister!

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:34.120
That's not what I...

00:20:34.740 --> 00:20:39.110
From now on, I won’t be alone at night anymore.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.580
We'll always be together.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.790
Always together?!

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:52.790
So, will you come with me to change the world?

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:55.480
To change the world?!

00:20:55.710 --> 00:21:02.330
Actually, to find the path to changing the world.

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:04.320
So, are you willing to come with me?

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.530
You bet!

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:24.650
Thank goodness, Chōhi.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:27.910
The villagers and the chief send you off with their blessings.

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.480
And this is because you apologized to them.

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:32.510
Yeah.

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:36.350
We will take the road on the right of the pine tree.

00:21:36.470 --> 00:21:38.560
Do you want to stop by your house before leaving?

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:40.010
No, it's alright.

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:44.480
What’s wrong?  Are you already missing the village?

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:50.730
No, it's not that… It's just... none of my gang members came to say goodbye.

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:57.890
I must've been a bad boss...

00:21:58.010 --> 00:21:59.900
I don't think that's the reason.

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:02.780
Look over there.

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:08.260
Big Boss!

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:11.140
You must train to become stronger!

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:14.430
Everyone will be waiting for you to return!

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:16.190
Big Boss!

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:17.090
Everyone...

00:22:17.090 --> 00:22:20.360
Don’t cry.  Tears bring bad luck for travelers.

00:22:21.790 --> 00:22:23.720
I am not crying!

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:28.720
People tend to remember the moment they part, until they meet again.

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:34.440
A good boss would not let anyone see her crying face.

00:22:34.940 --> 00:22:37.450
Go ahead and wave at them with a smiling face.

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:41.570
Okay!

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:46.060
My friends, I will be leaving now!

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:51.490
At the end of the 2nd century, when the world was filled with chaos.

00:22:51.690 --> 00:22:56.580
Those who gather power to fulfill their dark desires.

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:00.600
Warriors who want to test their strength...

00:23:00.870 --> 00:23:04.160
fighting to protect their loved ones.

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:10.440
Those who are filled with hopes are all linked and twined by the threads of fate.

00:23:11.440 --> 00:23:13.550
It's time to put away our capes.

00:23:13.650 --> 00:23:14.980
Because it is already spring.

00:23:16.260 --> 00:23:22.110
Enjoy Musou Princess's journey in the chaotic end of century.

00:23:33.380 --> 00:23:38.560
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:43.530
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:49.180
<i>Anywhere I am, it always turns into paradise.</i>

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:53.950
<i>Every season, mellow and carefree.
Today and tomorrow, always an adventure.</i>

00:23:53.950 --> 00:23:59.070
<i>I run away when times are tough.
But get involved when easy and fun.</i>

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:04.290
<i>If I stress, I just stop and smell the roses.  If there's a great opportunity, I go for it!</i>

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:09.310
<i>There are so many things that I want.</i>

00:24:09.310 --> 00:24:16.970
<i>I am so brave, that I can take on the invincible.</i>

00:24:17.070 --> 00:24:22.140
<i>After all said and done, I am the heroine of this world.</i>

00:24:22.140 --> 00:24:27.260
<i>The world revolves around me.  I am the center of the world!</i>

00:24:27.310 --> 00:24:32.380
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:24:32.380 --> 00:24:37.600
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:24:47.200 --> 00:24:52.200
<b>Cutie-cute</b>
